      "sourceTextSha256": "48fff9e7f188d420eeab27037fd87d79721c1e354de08e23a5c26c614b6e9cf4",
      "text": "Day 7 · Diving. Pick-up at the hotel and transfer to the port to board the diving boats. Fernando de Noronha is considered one of the best diving destinations in Brazil and the world, with rich marine life, colourful corals and remarkably clear, warm water (around 27 °C). Divers are grouped by experience: certified divers receive a briefing on the dive profile and safety procedures and dive in groups of four with one instructor or guide, to depths suited to their certification; beginners receive an introduction to the equipment and basic safety, and dive with one instructor each. Snacks and drinks after the dive; return to the port and transfer to the hotel. Duration: 3–4 hours, including about 30–40 minutes underwater.",
